      <div class="px-8 py-6 prose-dark">
        <p class="text-silver-400 leading-relaxed">Car Alpha respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and what choices you have. Our platform is designed to minimize data collection &mdash; we do not require user accounts, and our core tools work without collecting personal information.</p>
        <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm mt-3"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> February 15, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Last Updated:</strong> February 15, 2026</p>
