        </div>
        <div class="px-6 py-5 prose-dark">
          <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Car Alpha uses cookies and similar technologies for site functionality, analytics, and to support our affiliate partnerships. For detailed information about the cookies we use and how to manage them, please see our <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
          <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">We use analytics tools to understand how visitors interact with our site. These tools may collect information such as pages visited, time on site, and general geographic region. This data is used in aggregate and is not used to identify individual users.</p>
