        <div class="px-6 py-5 prose-dark">
          <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our site contains links to third-party services including insurance comparison tools, warranty providers, auto loan companies, and other affiliate partners. When you click an affiliate link and leave Car Alpha, your interaction with that third-party site is governed by their privacy policy, not ours.</p>
          <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Affiliate partners may use cookies or tracking pixels to attribute referrals. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for the full list of partner categories.</p>
          <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">We also use the NHTSA API for VIN decoding and recall data. These API calls are made directly from your browser to NHTSA servers and are subject to <a href="https://www.nhtsa.gov/privacy-policy" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">NHTSA's privacy policy</a>.</p>
